      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This really needs to be a thing. A \"quick resend\" function would be absolutely fantastic, I've been meaning to make a feedback post for this for a while and just found this. Right now, I tend to just do this method of copying the entire message and keeping it on my clipboard just in case I need to resend it, but sometimes I forget and I have to type an entire long message again because nobody read it.\n\nOVR Toolkit's OSC chatbox plug-in has this function and it's soooo useful. Really wish this was built into the game's keyboard.\n\nThe chatbox system itself doesn't need a history, just give senders the ability to re-send the last message.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-28T03:42:29.665Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes some messages might get missed (socially, not just on the technical level), it would be useful to be able to click to resend the most recent message or couple of messages instead of having to retype them.",
